# Test script for transition features

# Test background transition
@bg black
Test: Starting with black background

# Test background transition with dissolve
@bg black transition dissolve  
Test: Background transition with dissolve

# Test sprite transition (both old animation and new transition syntax)
@sprite kuro animation="dissolve"
Test: Sprite with animation dissolve (old syntax)

@sprite kuro transition="dissolve"
Test: Sprite with transition dissolve (new syntax)

@sprite kuro position="left" transition="fadein"
Test: Sprite with position and transition

